    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_61fe8073_value",
      "label": "TabHeader3 — Value",
      "default": "About the Inventor"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_e584b147_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "The best part about ThePhotoStick® Omni X is that you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick® Omni X works on:<br><br><strong>•&nbsp;Smartphones</strong> - iPhone &amp; Android<br><strong>•&nbsp;Computers</strong> - Mac &amp; PC (Windows)<br><strong>•&nbsp;Tablets</strong> - iPad &amp; Android<br><br>This means you can now safely store, access, and share ALL of your precious photo and video memories in a matter of minutes… no matter where they are… with ONE device. It’s going to prevent so many irreplaceable photos &amp; videos from being lost!"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_227ed7cc_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "The PhotoStick® was created by <strong>Mark Oman, a former VP &amp; GM of Hewlett Packard.</strong> Mark realized that since computers crash more frequently than we like, people run the risk of losing all their photos &amp; videos.<br><br>When it happened to him, he looked for a way to quickly and easily backup all his photos &amp; videos so that he would never have to worry about it happening to him again. Unfortunately, there was no such device. And thus, ThePhotoStick® was born."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_321037e0_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Is ThePhotoStick® Omni X easy to use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_303862e2_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. <br><br>But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <u><a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/4/en/topic/overview\" target=\"_blank\">User Guide</a></u> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_5d16bf16_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Which devices work with ThePhotoStick® Omni?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_6e5f95bd_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "ThePhotoStick Omni X works with all modern computers, smartphones, tablets, and computers right out of the box.It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br><strong>• Windows:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 and newer<br><strong>• Apple:</strong> iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br><strong>• Android</strong>: 8.0 and later<br><br>For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <u><a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-system-requirements\" target=\"_blank\">System Requirements</a></u> page. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_0abef34d_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Which version of ThePhotoStick® Omni X should I choose?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_8e2c92f7_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "This depends on how many photos and videos you have.<br><br>- The <strong>128GB</strong> version can hold up to 51,200 photos and videos, which will be plenty for most people.<br><br>- The <strong>256GB</strong> version holds up to roughly 102,400 photos and videos, giving you all the storage you'll ever need, perfect for large families with lots of memories. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_a992aa43_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni X?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_a9f8f0dd_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:<br><br>16GB - 6,400 photos<br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni, check out our Official User Guide.</em> "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_c8f20051_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "What photo and video file types can ThePhotoStick® Omni X save?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_ea6a562a_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X need to install anything on my computer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_090b2bec_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<strong>For computers (Mac or PC):</strong>&nbsp;ThePhotoStick® Omni does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br><strong>For phones (Android or iOS):</strong>&nbsp;ThePhotoStick® Omni offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started.<em></em> "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_c68f0a62_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni X as an ongoing backup solution?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_72862664_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people use the ThePhotoStick Omni X for weekly backups to make sure they are continually protecting their memories. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_e1cb7520_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "How does the 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_bc1a9f11_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our support team will&nbsp;help you with a return. <em><strong>We want you to be happy!</strong></em><br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-return-and-refund-process\" target=\"_self\">Returns and Refunds</a> page.  "
    },
